					</details>
				))}
			</div>

			<div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
				<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-blue to-blue-800 px-6 sm:px-10 py-10 text-center">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">Need a Deluge Valve Group for Your System?</h2>
					<p class="mt-3 text-blue-100 max-w-xl mx-auto text-sm leading-relaxed">Send the system flow and pressure, valve size, hazard type and detection method — our engineers can confirm the deluge valve group configuration within 12 hours.</p>
					<div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
						<a href="/contact/?product=Deluge%20Alarm%20Valve%20%28ZSFM%29" class="px-8 py-4 bg-brand-red text-white font-bold rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition">Request a Quote</a>
						<a href="https://wa.me/8618684324501?text=Hi%2C%20I%20need%20a%20deluge%20valve%20group%20for%20an%20open-head%20or%20monitor%20system" class="px-8 py-4 bg-white text-brand-blue font-bold rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-50 transition" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</article>
	</main>
</Layout>
